{
  "id": 1029,
  "name": "gold-leaf",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "loot",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/24/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きんいろの　ふしぎな　はっぱ。\nこの　はっぱを　つける　きは\nみつかって　いない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "금빛의 신비한 나뭇잎.\n이 나뭇잎이 자라는 나무는\n아직 발견되지 않았다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不可思議的金色葉子。\n至今還未發現\n長有這種葉子的樹。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une feuille dorée mystérieuse. Elle ne semble\nappartenir à aucun arbre connu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein rätselhaftes Blatt mit goldener Färbung. Bisher hat\nman noch keinen Baum entdeckt, an dem solche Blätter\nwachsen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Extraña hoja de color dorado. Se desconoce de qué\nárbol procede.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una strana foglia dorata. Nessuno sa da che albero\nprovenga.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious gold leaf. No trees with this leaf have\nbeen found yet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "金色の　不思議な　はっぱ。\nこの　はっぱを　つける　木は\n見つかって　いない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "神奇的金色叶子。\n至今仍未发现能长出\n这种叶子的树木。",
